        "original_id": "adea0df6-0bf9-5ad4-9209-2ddca2ff0431",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Spanky, DJ Pierre, Herb J, Paul Woolford, Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay, ASC, xxxy, Appleblim, Al Tourettes\n- Groups/Companies: Phuture, Halocyan Records\n- Places: Chicago, Los Angeles, United Kingdom, continental Europe\n- Genres/Scenes: acid house, rave, techno\n\nFacts:\n- Phuture is an American acid-house group of electronic musicians based in Chicago.\n- Phuture was founded in 1985 by Spanky, DJ Pierre, and Herb J.\n- Acid house spread to the United Kingdom and continental Europe, where DJs played it in the acid house scene and later in the rave scene.\n- Halocyan Records is based in Los Angeles, California.\n- Halocyan Records has released music by DJ Pierre of Phuture, Paul Woolford, techno pioneer Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay as Sistol, ASC, xxxy, Appleblim and Al Tourettes, and Extrawelt.",
